{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "The nightly rollup check (bash verify_pipeline.sh) fails on a checksum\ndrift, and it is a different row every time I rerun it. Please get the\npipeline verifying clean so the rollup can merge."}
